zl1 camera on-screen measurement -- 2026-09-23
=============================================

The question: doc 68 §5 says the valid evidence that a camera preview is being
composited is the COMPOSITOR's own utime+stime rate from /proc/<pid>/stat, with the
display ON. Its table is:

    display ON,  no client        1.2 ticks/s
    display ON,  preview running  27.8 - 50
    display OFF, preview running  4.8

Two runs were needed because the first one left the display as it was found (off).


